# Stable spec ID: difford-mai-tai. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(rum; Caribbean blend, aged 6-10 years) 2 fl oz
(orange liqueur; curaçao @ Ferrand Dry Curaçao) 1/2 fl oz
(lime: juice, fresh) 3/4 fl oz
(orgeat @ Monin Almond) 1/3 fl oz
(simple syrup, 2:1 sugar to water; 65.0°Brix) 1/4 fl oz
Optional [
  (rum; blackstrap) 1/6 fl oz
]

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(rocks glass, double old-fashioned)

::instructions
<shake, all measured ingredients except the optional float rum with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into (rocks glass, double old-fashioned) filled with crushed ice>
Optional [
  (rum; blackstrap) <float, on top>
]
<garnish, with a spent lime half and mint sprigs and a fruit stick of pineapple cubes and a Luxardo maraschino cherry>

